    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/9ae629892bd2d492a38a96cb3529b9f9.avif?t=1747926304\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tWelcome to Werewolves Revenge, a\u00a0<strong>first person social deduction game</strong> where <strong>deception</strong>, <strong>strategy</strong>, and <strong>manipulation</strong> are your greatest weapons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/5837029795cf0b0d4f22bd2753ec1536.avif?t=1747926304\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/f8c1f44289ab380f4480ca7ba618ffb0.webp?t=1747926304\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tUncover hidden roles and objectives through <strong>bluffing</strong>, <strong>strategic questioning</strong>, and <strong>keen observation</strong>. Vanquish all horrors before it's too late, or hunt down and\u00a0meticulously kill the villagers one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/d8d2eaf43adbd2b921912379b7fd3f06.avif?t=1747926304\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/5c8cd32ba3d543044d041dfe013804fb.webp?t=1747926304\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience<strong>\u00a0100+ roles</strong>\u00a0in the standard set, each offering distinct abilities and win conditions,\u00a0<strong>5 factions</strong> in a constant and intricate struggle for power, and support for <strong>community roles</strong> and <strong>sets</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/f5a942dea5fe98b176ffe1657b2399c3.avif?t=1747926304\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/c3816d94a82a96a1aedc69f73701675e.webp?t=1747926304\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Express yourself with deep <strong>character customization</strong>! Personalize your character with a vast array of clothes, armor, accessories, and hairstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/e38434de758694d267fd3a14422d9a19.avif?t=1747926304\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/2d0bc4ae38b48960625bd6027b09887d.webp?t=1747926304\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tExplore a multitude of <strong>detailed and atmospheric locations. </strong>Including a bustling<strong> Tavern,</strong> a once secure <strong>Village</strong> now threatened by Werewolves,<strong>\u00a0</strong>the eerie depths of the <strong>Werewolf Cave</strong>, and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/9ae629892bd2d492a38a96cb3529b9f9.avif?t=1747926304\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tWelcome to Werewolves Revenge, a\u00a0<strong>first person social deduction game</strong> where <strong>deception</strong>, <strong>strategy</strong>, and <strong>manipulation</strong> are your greatest weapons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/5837029795cf0b0d4f22bd2753ec1536.avif?t=1747926304\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/f8c1f44289ab380f4480ca7ba618ffb0.webp?t=1747926304\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tUncover hidden roles and objectives through <strong>bluffing</strong>, <strong>strategic questioning</strong>, and <strong>keen observation</strong>. Vanquish all horrors before it's too late, or hunt down and\u00a0meticulously kill the villagers one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/d8d2eaf43adbd2b921912379b7fd3f06.avif?t=1747926304\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/5c8cd32ba3d543044d041dfe013804fb.webp?t=1747926304\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience<strong>\u00a0100+ roles</strong>\u00a0in the standard set, each offering distinct abilities and win conditions,\u00a0<strong>5 factions</strong> in a constant and intricate struggle for power, and support for <strong>community roles</strong> and <strong>sets</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/f5a942dea5fe98b176ffe1657b2399c3.avif?t=1747926304\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/c3816d94a82a96a1aedc69f73701675e.webp?t=1747926304\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Express yourself with deep <strong>character customization</strong>! Personalize your character with a vast array of clothes, armor, accessories, and hairstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/e38434de758694d267fd3a14422d9a19.avif?t=1747926304\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/2d0bc4ae38b48960625bd6027b09887d.webp?t=1747926304\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tExplore a multitude of <strong>detailed and atmospheric locations. </strong>Including a bustling<strong> Tavern,</strong> a once secure <strong>Village</strong> now threatened by Werewolves,<strong>\u00a0</strong>the eerie depths of the <strong>Werewolf Cave</strong>, and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p>",
